    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter a dormitory, and this dormitory is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, I've got some help for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you are curious about what this is? This is an escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to challenge yourself? Want to blow off some steam? Whatever you want, I can help you get it, as long as you lie down on this bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to the topic, this is a horror-style escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to avoid the pursuit of fierce ghosts and find a dormitory suitable for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the economy to build forts to defend against the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can only build on the empty floor in the room. After the empty floor is clicked, the construction menu will pop up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to selectively build buildings according to their own economic status and expand their advantages step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player defeats the ghost, the game is won; if the player is eliminated by the ghost, the game is lost.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter a dormitory, and this dormitory is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't worry, I've got some help for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you are curious about what this is? This is an escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to challenge yourself? Want to blow off some steam? Whatever you want, I can help you get it, as long as you lie down on this bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to the topic, this is a horror-style escape strategy casual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to avoid the pursuit of fierce ghosts and find a dormitory suitable for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the economy to build forts to defend against the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can only build on the empty floor in the room. After the empty floor is clicked, the construction menu will pop up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to selectively build buildings according to their own economic status and expand their advantages step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player defeats the ghost, the game is won; if the player is eliminated by the ghost, the game is lost.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Haunted Dorm&quot; is a 2D tower defense game. In the game, players need to evade the pursuit of dream hunters, find a suitable dormitory to hide in, and develop the economy to build forts to resist the dream hunters.",
